@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397171\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>Sismo a\\u00a0Paratebueno, Cundinamarca, Colombia</b>\\n</li><li>Hora Local: 06:11:12 25/10/2026\\n</li><li>Latitud: 4.40\\u00b0\\n</li><li>Longitud: -73.29\\u00b0\\n</li><li>Profundidad: Superficial (menor a 30 km)\\n</li><li>Magnitud: 2.7\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:37-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:37-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397164\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397164\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfPor qu\\u00e9 se reportan varias magnitudes para un mismo sismo?\\u00a0\\u00a0</b>\\n</li><li>Porque la primera informaci\\u00f3n proviene de estaciones cercanas y se ajusta conforme m\\u00e1s datos llegan de diferentes sensores. La ciencia sigue calculando despu\\u00e9s del primer aviso.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:06-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:06-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397158\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397158\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfC\\u00f3mo se sabe que va a temblar?</b>\\n</li><li>Los sismos no se pueden predecir, pero los sism\\u00f3grafos y aceler\\u00f3grafos detectan los movimientos del suelo en tiempo real para alertarnos lo m\\u00e1s r\\u00e1pido posible.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:49-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:49-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397138\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397138\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfQU\\u00c9 DIFERENCIA HAY ENTRE TERREMOTO, TEMBLOR, SISMO Y MOVIMIENTO TEL\\u00daRICO?</b>\\n</li><li>En realidad, los cuatro t\\u00e9rminos son sin\\u00f3nimos, pero en Latino Am\\u00e9rica se le ha dado especial \\u00e9nfasis a la expresi\\u00f3n terremoto para ser asignada a los sismos destructores o que han causado v\\u00edctimas.\\u200b\\u200b\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:41-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:41-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397137\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397137\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfCU\\u00c1NTOS SISM\\u00d3GRAFOS HAY?</b>\\n</li><li><i>RED SISMOL\\u00d3GICA NACIONAL DE COLOMBIA-RSNC</i>\\n</li><li>\\u200bEl SGC tiene un total de 339 estaciones s\\u00edsmicas, ubicadas en todo el territorio colombiano y en zonas espec\\u00edficas como los volcanes activos. 206 estaciones s\\u00edsmicas se ubican cubriendo todo el territorio correspondientes a la Red S\\u00edsmica Nacional.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:22-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:22-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397136\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397136\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li>Son 133 estaciones s\\u00edsmicas instaladas en los volcanes activos colombianos que se monitorean permanentemente en tres observatorios vulcanol\\u00f3gicos y sismol\\u00f3gicos.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:11-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:11-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397135\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397135\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfQU\\u00c9 ES EL SERVICIO GEOL\\u00d3GICO COLOMBIANO?</b>\\n</li><li>El SGC una entidad centenaria de ciencia y tecnolog\\u00eda adscrita al Ministerio de Minas y Energ\\u00eda, que tiene como objetivo contribuir al desarrollo econ\\u00f3mico y social del pa\\u00eds, a trav\\u00e9s de la investigaci\\u00f3n en geociencias b\\u00e1sicas y aplicadas del subsuelo, el potencial de sus recursos, la evaluaci\\u00f3n y monitoreo de amenazas de origen geol\\u00f3gico, la gesti\\u00f3n integral del conocimiento geocient\\u00edfico, la investigaci\\u00f3n y el control nuclear y radiactivo, atendiendo las prioridades de las pol\\u00edticas del Gobierno Nacional.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en Colombia hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SGC\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:01-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:40:01-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (SGC) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397134\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/colombia/temblor-en-colombia-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismos-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-reporte-de-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-segun-sgc-servicio-geologico-colombiano-tolima-bogota-co-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397134\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><a href=https://elcomercio.pe/noticias/temblor-en-colombia/>\\u00bfDe qu\\u00e9 magnitud y en d\\u00f3nde fue el \\u00faltimo temblor?</a>\\n Mira aqu\\u00ed los reportes del Servicio Geol\\u00f3gico Colombiano (\\n<a href=https://elcomercio.pe/noticias/servicio-geologico/>SGC</a>\\n) sobre los \\u00faltimos sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/EWBZKPJOY5BAFDYJFDLS55G5HU.jpg?auth=05ac3cfb73c481537ef2f1e7a26c0d4f952d51e80f59aa2a212c0c552282313c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}]}], \"@context\":