 AL SUROESTE DE CD HIDALGO, CHIS.</b>\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T16:05:49-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T16:05:49-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397588\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397588\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfPOR QU\\u00c9 NUNCA DEBER\\u00cdAS USAR UN ASCENSOR DURANTE UN SISMO?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>Los especialistas recomiendan nunca utilizar el ascensor durante un sismo o terremoto, ya que este podr\\u00eda desprenderse de su estructura y caer desde una gran altura con personas adentro.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T15:45:45-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T15:45:45-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397543\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397543\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfQU\\u00c9 HACER EN CASO DE UN TSUNAMI?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>Si recibes informaci\\u00f3n oficial de alerta o alarma de tsunami o ves que se recoge el mar, evac\\u00faa hacia zonas en altura. Mu\\u00e9vete hacia una zona libre de inundaci\\u00f3n y dir\\u00edgete al punto de encuentro m\\u00e1s cercano. Si no puedes llegar hasta una zona en altura, sube a un piso superior o al techo de una construcci\\u00f3n s\\u00f3lida.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T15:25:48-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T15:25:48-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397503\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397503\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfQU\\u00c9 ES UN ENJAMBRE S\\u00cdSMICO?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>Un enjambre s\\u00edsmico es un grupo de terremotos que ocurren en una misma \\u00e1rea durante un corto periodo de tiempo. A diferencia de un terremoto \\u00fanico y fuerte, los enjambres s\\u00edsmicos suelen consistir en numerosos temblores menores. A menudo, no hay un terremoto principal que desencadene el enjambre, sino que los eventos s\\u00edsmicos ocurren de forma m\\u00e1s o menos continua y est\\u00e1n relacionados con procesos tect\\u00f3nicos.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T14:15:42-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T14:15:42-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397365\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397365\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>REVISA LO QUE UNA MOCHILA DE EMERGENCIAS PARA EL HOGAR DEBE CONTENER.</b>\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/resizer/v2/GQZDCOJNGEYC2MRVKQYTKORUGI.jpg?auth=eb788435b0a8a183a988119aca49e87e3da32050a93a7a3dc66b3b8681310c5c?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/resizer/v2/GQZDCOJNGEYC2MRVKQYTKORUGI.jpg?auth=eb788435b0a8a183a988119aca49e87e3da32050a93a7a3dc66b3b8681310c5c?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/resizer/v2/GQZDCOJNGEYC2MRVKQYTKORUGI.jpg?auth=eb788435b0a8a183a988119aca49e87e3da32050a93a7a3dc66b3b8681310c5c?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T13:46:29-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T13:46:29-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397313\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397313\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfQU\\u00c9 DEBE CONTENER MI MOCHILA DE EMERGENCIA?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>\\u2022 Art\\u00edculos indispensables de higiene\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>\\u2022 Botiqu\\u00edn (vendas, gasa, alcohol, pastillas, agua oxigenada, etc)\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>\\u2022 Abrigo\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>\\u2022 Alimentos no perecibles (latas de at\\u00fan, barra de cereales, chocolates, frutos secos, etc) y dinero\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>\\u2022 Art\\u00edculos de comunicaci\\u00f3n\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>\\u2022 Art\\u00edculos espec\\u00edficos para beb\\u00e9s e infantes, de uso femenino, para el adulto mayor y para otras necesidades b\\u00e1sicas.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T13:33:39-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T13:33:39-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397290\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397290\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>SISMO DE MAGNITUD 4.1 LOC. A 27 KM AL SUROESTE DE CD HIDALGO, CHIS.</b>\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T13:32:53-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T13:32:53-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397285\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397285\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>SISMO MAGNITUD 4.0 LOC. 44 KM AL SUROESTE DE\\u00a0CD HIDALGO, CHIS.</b>\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T12:10:32-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T12:10:32-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397243\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397243\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfCU\\u00c1L ES EL SISMO DE MAYOR MAGNITUD QUE SACUDI\\u00d3 LA CIUDAD DE M\\u00c9XICO?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>El 19 de septiembre de 1985, la ciudad de M\\u00e9xico experiment\\u00f3 un devastador terremoto de 8.1 en la escala de magnitud, con su epicentro en la costa del Pac\\u00edfico. Se estima que al menos 10,000 personas perdieron la vida, afectando y derribando miles de estructuras de vivienda, comercio y de servicios p\\u00fablicos.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/resizer/v2/GMZDCNZNGEYC2MRVKQYTAORTGI.png?auth=167f929b84da8ad692e20a694309119322aa3bad0b0dbc3ab8dce6aeab2d2698?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/resizer/v2/GMZDCNZNGEYC2MRVKQYTAORTGI.png?auth=167f929b84da8ad692e20a694309119322aa3bad0b0dbc3ab8dce6aeab2d2698?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/resizer/v2/GMZDCNZNGEYC2MRVKQYTAORTGI.png?auth=167f929b84da8ad692e20a694309119322aa3bad0b0dbc3ab8dce6aeab2d2698?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T11:55:50-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T11:55:50-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397221\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397221\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfCU\\u00c1L ES LA DIFERENCIA ENTRE LA MAGNITUD Y LA INTENSIDAD DE UN SISMO?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>Son escalas para medir el tama\\u00f1o o el impacto de un temblor. La escala de magnitud se obtiene de forma num\\u00e9rica a partir de registros obtenidos por sism\\u00f3grafos y est\\u00e1 relacionada con el tama\\u00f1o y la energ\\u00eda liberada durante un temblor. La escala de intensidad se asigna en funci\\u00f3n a los da\\u00f1os o efectos causados al hombre y sus construcciones.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T11:52:56-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T11:52:56-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397212\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397212\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfPOR QU\\u00c9 OCURREN TANTOS SISMOS EN M\\u00c9XICO?</b>\\n</li><li> \\n</li><li>En el contexto de la Tect\\u00f3nica de Placas, M\\u00e9xico est\\u00e1 ubicado en el llamado Cintur\\u00f3n de Fuego, donde se registra gran parte de los movimientos tel\\u00faricos a nivel mundial. El pa\\u00eds se ubica en la Placa Norteamericana, limitado en su porci\\u00f3n sur y oeste, con las placas de Cocos, Rivera y del Pac\\u00edfico.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T10:03:49-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T10:03:49-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397170\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397170\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>Sismo a 47 km al SO de Ciudad Hidalgo, Chiapas, M\\u00e9xico</b>\\n</li><li>Hora Local: 07:45:50 25/10/2026\\n</li><li>Latitud: 14.433\\u00b0\\n</li><li>Longitud: -92.503\\u00b0\\n</li><li>Profundidad: 5.0 km\\n</li><li>Magnitud: 4.1\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fcce