l Madrid</b> por la fecha 10 de LaLiga empieza a las 3:00 PM de Perú y 10:00 PM de España este domingo 25 de octubre del 2026 en el estadio Camp Nou."},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"3GZDAD3DW5GKHIQNYTFNC5ELLQ","type":"list","items":[{"_id":"BWRZEKIB3FELRMWVH22IGDV3HU","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en México, Guatemala, Honduras, Costa Rica: 2:00 PM"},{"_id":"VXWF4BFSVFACLD2YGZBRHIKGQI","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en Perú, Colombia y Ecuador: 3:00 PM"},{"_id":"QJYQCKHBYNGQZEV6PLHTWHEA5Y","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en Bolivia, Venezuela, Estados Unidos: 4:00 PM"},{"_id":"KBG7BZJROBFGTHU26UMEDPR7DU","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en Argentina, Brasil, Uruguay, Paraguay, Chile: 5:00 PM"},{"_id":"UKB5FQCEV5HUPCCDMFQQHHEHGY","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en España: 10:00 PM "}]},{"level":3,"_id":"LROO7EXRUJE6JP2A2664FVKGYA","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>¿En qué canal TV ver Barcelona vs. Real Madrid por LaLiga?</b>"},{"_id":"SNPYRBX34FCHJGCQJ6WHFTV7ZE","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"El Clásico entre <b>Barcelona vs. Real Madrid</b> será transmitido a través de DirecTV y DGO en Perú y resto de Sudamérica. Mientras que en España lo televisa DAZN y Movistar Plus+. "},{"_id":"RB2YZMGQ6JE5HCQRJ2LXWXN55E","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Por otro lado, en México, El Clásico será transmitido a través de izzi y Sky Sports. Y finalmente, En Estados Unidos, la transmisión de el clásico va a través de ESPN+, ESPN Deportes y ABC."},{"level":3,"_id":"VIB6LG2VANHAJHK5JYF22VIRBM","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>Hora y canal TV para ver Barcelona vs. Real Madrid por LaLiga</b>"},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"STI7IS