DIRECTV (Prepago o Pospago): Tu suscripción ya incluye DGO. Solo debes registrarte en la web de MiDIRECTV de tu país utilizando tu número de cliente o RUT/DNI. Esas mismas credenciales (correo y contraseña) te servirán para abrir DGO."},{"_id":"IFQJMYVUVVFHVIACVRZS7HOJ2I","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Si NO eres cliente de DIRECTV: Puedes contratar DGO de forma independiente contratando un plan mensual con tarjeta de crédito directo en el sitio oficial de DGO."}]},{"level":3,"_id":"N6FO6ETQQFFRRMKCWSFWVVLZ5E","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>¿Cómo ver DGO ONLINE, Barcelona vs Real Madrid?</b>"},{"_id":"I3XEKHZ5JVFAVB7ERH2M3S3WQY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Busca “DGO” en la tienda de aplicaciones de tus dispositivos compatibles:"},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"3VL57HEHXVEZZKF2HFGUSGGBJI","type":"list","items":[{"_id":"SXB3NVGNRJFTTLR7YBQV6VC7FE","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Celulares y Tablets: Disponible en Google Play Store (Android 6 o superior) y App Store de Apple (iOS 11 o superior)."},{"_id":"K4KXHFOL2RBI5GZSPGJMO5PSCE","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Smart TVs y Dispositivos de Streaming: Compatible con Android TV / Google TV, Samsung (Tizen), LG (webOS), Apple TV, Roku y Amazon Fire TV Stick."},{"_id":"HEGGTK5GK5CBNL4PBUTEDA6DQY","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Computadoras: Puedes ingresar directamente desde navegadores Chrome o Firefox en DGO Web."}]},{"subtype":"custom-ec-blocks","_id":"AMYBBF7UJNBUBJTXHHZYVLWWEY","embed":{"id":"no-fetch","config":{"data":{"date":1792803476,"conversions":[{"duration":"23.44","template":{"format":{"name":"H.264 Baseline","key":"mp4"},"name":"180p","id":33450653,"key":"JfDM4jL3","required":true},"link":{"path":"/videos/zvVN0Qbv-JfDM4jL3.mp4","protocol":"http","address":"cdn.j